WEBVTT

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:20.250
Strike!

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:28.750
Ienai kimochi ni kizuite

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:34.880
Ibitsu de bukiyou na kotoba de tsutaeru kara

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:38.040
Kitto kimi ni

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:50.250
Itsumo gomakashichau yo

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.670
(Doki doki barenai youni)

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:57.880
Zenbu mabushisugiru kimi no sei dayo

00:00:58.130 --> 00:01:00.920
Kawaiku nante narenaiyo

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.670
(Datte niawanai desho?)

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:05.500
Sono me ni utsuru sora mo

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.830
Massugu mitsumerarenakute

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:14.170
Uso darake no sekai ni itsumade iru no?

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:19.080
Kono mamaja nanimo kaerarenai

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.790
Sonna no iya dayo

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:27.920
Moshimo kamisama ga kimochi tsugete kuretatoshitemo

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:33.210
Itsuka jibun no koe de kimi no koto ga suki dato tsutaetai

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:41.960
Moshimo ibitsudemo taisetsu na omoi dokoka kiechau mae ni

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:45.170
Yuuki dasu kara

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:59.880
The Wand, Maxed Out, and Favored by the Gods

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:05.170
Hmm...

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.710
Huh. Let's see...

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:08.170
Oh!

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:10.540
This is it!

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:14.540
O-okay, here goes!

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:23.080
Oh! Let me guess. You must be Endo!

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:24.630
Uh, yes!

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.330
I'm Shihono's older sister, Chiyono. It's nice to meet you.

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:30.540
Oh, nice to meet you, too!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.290
Thanks for being a good friend to Shihono.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.880
Um...s-sure...

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:41.420
Endo!

00:02:43.380 --> 00:02:45.920
Thanks for coming! Did you find the house okay?

00:02:46.210 --> 00:02:47.500
Uh, yeah.

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:50.080
H-her outfit's so cute.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.000
Well, come on in!

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.170
Oh, right.

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:56.580
July

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:58.540
You know, my big sister left just a moment ago.

00:02:58.790 --> 00:03:00.540
Th-thanks for having me...

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.330
Oh hey, here.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:02.960
Hmm?

00:03:03.710 --> 00:03:05.710
Wow, those look good!

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:08.130
Thanks so much. I'll put them in the fridge.

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:08.920
Okay.

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:09.920
Go ahead and have a seat.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.080
Oh.

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:20.330
Huh...!

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:22.330
So, what did you think?

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:23.210
Huh?

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:26.040
"Lieselotte's Memoir" from the fan disc!

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.500
Oh, uh...

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:28.170
Hmm?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.250
I cried! Uh, I'm a little embarrassed, 

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:34.290
Ballroom

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:34.290
Heartbroken, Lieselotte hurried away from Sieg!

00:03:32.710 --> 00:03:34.080
but it made me cry!

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:36.250
Right? Who wouldn't?!

00:03:36.830 --> 00:03:39.040
I feel so bad for Lieselotte!

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:42.750
How she doesn't know how to express her love for Sieg...

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:46.500
How she secretly admires Fiene's free spirit...

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:52.330
How she can never say what she means, and as
she agonizes over her tenuous relationship with Sieg...

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:57.670
the Witch of Yore eats away at her psyche,
turning her into a hideous monster.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:00.250
In anguish, Sieg makes a brutal choice...!

00:04:03.130 --> 00:04:04.580
Seriously, how could they?!

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:09.040
The game looks so sparkly and cute, and
Love Me Magically! is such a peppy title!

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:11.040
How can it be so dark?!

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:11.960
I know, right?

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:15.460
And did you know? It's not just Liese-tan who dies!

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:16.380
What?

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:22.710
All of the love interests have at least one route
where they meet a tragic end.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:23.460
Huh?!

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:25.460
Especially Baldur!

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:28.670
Bal actually ends up dying in most of the routes.

00:04:28.670 --> 00:04:29.460
What?!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:33.710
He's straight and earnest to a fault,
and clumsy when it comes to romantic matters.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:39.290
So he protects Fiene, his one true love,
and gets killed by the Witch of Yore in her place.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.000
Bal is Liese-tan's cousin,

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:46.830
a member of the noble Riefenstahl household.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:52.290
So basically, the top two on the
"most likely to die" list are related!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.250
I don't even know where to begin.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:58.210
They do survive in the Reverse Harem Route...

00:04:58.670 --> 00:04:59.880
"Reverse Harem"?

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:04.040
It's where everyone, including Liese-tan,
falls for Fiene in a happy ending. 

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.080
Is that really a happy ending?

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:09.580
Everyone falls for Fiene and she leads them all on?

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:13.630
But that can only lead to an ugly mess!
How's that okay for the kingdom's future?!

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:16.750
Love Me

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:16.750
Magically!

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:19.420
Hey...

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:20.540
Hmm?

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:25.580
Do you think we could use our commentary
and analysis to save Bal from his fate, too?

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:28.540
Huh? Oh!

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:33.670
Endo! I was totally thinking that, too!

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:34.960
You too, Kobayashi?

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:35.540
Yeah!

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:39.380
An ending where no one dies—
Liese-tan, Bal, or otherwise!

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:44.250
That would really be the best happy end
to end all happy ends, you know?

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.080
Yeah, I totally agree!

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:53.420
If Liese-tan never gets possessed by the Witch of Yore,
Bal wouldn't have to die protecting Fiene, so...

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:57.210
Right! We make sure Lieselotte
stays happy. Let's do this!

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:57.790
Yeah!

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:21.000
Ah, I see Lieselotte's at the same table as Fiene today!

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:26.500
It appears she wants to sit closer to Fiene,
but doesn't know how to go about doing it.

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:29.080
Ooh, and there's our Sieg!

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:32.250
Great, now we can communicate with them!

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:42.880
His Highness!

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.630
Hi there, Lieselotte.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:51.250
Good day to you, Your Highness.

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:54.250
Sieg!

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:58.670
There's a petal stuck in Liese-tan's hair.
Please take it out for her!

00:06:58.670 --> 00:07:00.330
Of course, Your Holiness.

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:03.790
Lieselotte, there's a petal in your hair.

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:18.080
B-betrothed though we may be, may I ask you
to refrain from touching me so casually in public?! 

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:25.790
Ooh! Despite what she says,
just look at how pleased Lieselotte actually looks!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:27.670
You have an image to uphold, do you not? 

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:27.580
The key word here is "in public,"

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:28.500
Why would you act so carelessly?

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:31.790
which basically means she wouldn't mind
you touching her if no one was looking!

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:44.880
Does that mean you wouldn't mind
as long as we were alone?

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:52.000
Boom, now that's a critical hit!
She's so lovestruck she's forgotten how to talk!

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:58.830
That was perfect, Sieg! The mood is so lovey-dovey
that I almost feel bad Fiene has to be present for this!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.580
Huh? Fiene?

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.170
Oh no! Don't go!

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.000
The Royal Academy of Magic-Dining Hall

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.000
Fiene

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.000
That was a good meal!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:09.500
I guess because Fiene's the main character,
we can't see what's going on when she's not around.

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:13.170
Nooo! I wanna see more than just Fiene's POV!

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:17.170
If I'm really a god, I wanna watch over Liese-tan instead!

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:28.420
Wh-what's this...?

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.380
Lady Lieselotte?!

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:33.290
L..Liese-tan's glowing?

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:35.460
Like when the MC gets favored by the gods!

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:37.630
Look at this...

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:43.380
The Royal Academy of Magic-Dining Hall

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:43.380
Siegwald

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:43.380
Wh-what's this…?

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:42.750
Does this mean we can follow Lieselotte now?!

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.790
Favored... by the gods?!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.460
What was that?

00:08:52.460 --> 00:08:54.170
Did you see Lady Lieselotte glowing?!

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:55.080
Was that magic?!

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.290
Fear not! 

00:08:56.670 --> 00:09:01.790
As of this moment, the goddess Lady Kobayashee
has blessed Lieselotte with her divine favor!

00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:05.670
Me? Favored by a goddess?

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:07.330
"Divine favor"?

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:13.330
Towards the end of the game, there's a chance
for Fiene to power up with favor from the gods.

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:16.290
So something similar just happened here?

00:09:16.710 --> 00:09:18.540
Of course she would choose Lady Lieselotte!

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:19.790
What a blessing!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:23.000
Our kingdom's future queen
has found favor with a goddess!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.170
Oh... oh my...

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:30.080
Look at her blush at the mention of "future queen"!

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:33.710
Hmm? What happened here?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:37.540
Lady Lieselotte just received the favor of a goddess.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:38.330
What, really?

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.170
Lieselotte.

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:47.790
Oh come on, just make her
your wife already, you crown prince!

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:48.290
Huh?

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:54.000
After all, Liese-tan's actions always
stem from her love for you, Sieg!

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:03.130
Ah indeed, my fiancée is simply too cute.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.790
The Royal Academy of Magic-Dining Hall

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.790
Lieselotte 

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.960
Hey, maybe you can bestow
your favor on someone too, Endo.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.330
What, me?

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:12.460
Hmm...

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.380
I'll give it a try.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.580
If I really am a god...

00:10:19.460 --> 00:10:21.250
I want to bestow my favor on Baldur!

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:30.040
Why?

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:30.670
Why?

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:31.420
Why?

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:32.540
Why Baldur?

00:10:33.040 --> 00:10:35.670
What, me? Wh-why?

00:10:36.170 --> 00:10:36.960
Why him?!

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:42.960
Well, he's the second most likely to die and uh...
I feel like I can kinda relate to him.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:43.710
Huh.

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:48.790
This time, His Holiness Lord Endoh
has blessed Baldur with his divine favor!

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.040
I-I feel nothing but surprise.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.420
Sieg, listen.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:54.960
Hmm?

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:59.210
Fiene eventually has to fight a very powerful enemy.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.750
"A very powerful enemy"?

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:06.460
Could you tell Bal to stick with Fiene as much
as possible around the academy and protect her?

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:08.790
Baldur.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:11.250
Your Highness!

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.000
I have a message from the gods.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:17.380
Miss Fiene here must eventually
fight a very powerful enemy.

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:19.210
"Fight"?

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:23.250
From now on, you are to protect
Miss Fiene as much as you possibly can.

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:27.330
That is why the gods have
bestowed this power upon you.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:38.040
In other words, against this impossible foe
the gods have chosen my cousin Liese as your shield
and me as Miss Fiene's, if I understand correctly.

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:38.920
Bal!

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.080
Liese.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:43.630
Uh?

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:47.170
Understood, Your Highness Prince Siegwald!

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:52.000
We of House Riefenstahl hereby swear to serve
the crown, this kingdom, and Your Highness

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:57.210
to use this power bestowed upon us
by the gods with due integrity and honor! 

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:00.330
Well, I guess that's not entirely wrong.

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:03.290
I thank you both. I'm counting on you.

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:04.000
Your Highness!

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:06.420
How lovely!

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.250
Impressive, House Riefenstahl!

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:11.290
The Riefenstahl loyalty is something else.

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:16.500
But a prince who gets protected
by his fiancée? I dunno...

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:19.130
I suppose I should train some more, myself.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.210
Yeah, do that!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.670
You can do it, Sieg!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:22.920
Right...

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:30.880
But actually, more than protecting Fiene,
I want Bal to get together with her.

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:31.540
Huh?

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:36.380
If Sieg and Liese-tan get together
as well as Fiene and Bal,

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:39.420
I doubt the Witch of Yore would
be able to gain any influence.

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.040
Ah, gotcha.

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:44.540
Anyway, this is great. Let's keep it up!

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:45.210
Yeah!

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:04.710
August

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.460
Summer Koshien Baseball

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:15.460
Tournament Starts Today

00:13:26.210 --> 00:13:29.380
We just need one more character
and we'll have everybody.

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:31.080
Why hasn't it happened yet?

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:35.580
You mean Artur, right? You said
he's a priest who serves the Church?

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:40.630
Yeah. In the normal game he should be
coming back to the academy soon. 

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:41.790
I see.

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:51.040
Fire-based powers are only half as
effective against water-based ones and...

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:52.080
Hey, Sieg!

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:58.960
Art! Long time no-

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:03.710
So hey, I hear you've been chasing
after some first-year girl recently.

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:07.040
And little miss princess Riefenstahl is infuriated?

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:08.630
You're such a dog, Sieg.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:14.710
Your gossip isn't up to date.
It's true Lieselotte and I had a slight misunderstanding, 

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:18.380
but our relationship is now
exceedingly smooth and agreeable.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:19.580
Huh.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:23.210
By the way, thank you for your work
on helping the recovery from the flood.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.250
Well, of course. 

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:29.210
When you're born in a family of priests,
it's only natural to provide that kind of aid!

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:30.250
I see.

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:35.080
So what's this Fiene girl like, actually?
I hear she's amazingly cute!

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.630
Have you gotten with her yet?

00:14:36.630 --> 00:14:40.250
Of course not! I'm betrothed to Lieselotte!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.170
Wh...whoa, there. Chill out.

00:14:42.170 --> 00:14:44.540
Were you always the type to actually get this angry?

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.790
Oh, uh well... Sorry.

00:14:46.790 --> 00:14:48.290
No, it was my bad. 

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:50.750
So anyway, this Fiene girl.

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:52.250
Won't you introduce me to her?

00:14:53.290 --> 00:14:55.380
Don't tell me she's your next target?

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.000
No, no. 

00:14:57.460 --> 00:15:02.330
She has an outstanding capacity for magic and
she's adept at healing and supportive magic, isn't she?

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.210
True...

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:08.460
The Church's higher-ups all keep nagging me
to recruit her as a potential priestess.

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:09.290
Ah...

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:17.130
If she's great at healing and support, but inept at
offensive magic like me, she'd make a perfect priestess.

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:21.330
It's true she isn't skilled at offensive magic, but...

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:21.960
Huh?

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:25.040
I could explain, but I think you should see for yourself.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.000
Okay...

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:30.040
Uh, a practice match?

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:34.080
I apologize for the sudden request,
but if you could, with Artur here.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.540
All right.

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:37.750
Aw, thanks!

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:40.790
Oh, right. Let's have Baldur join in as well.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.460
Huh?

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.500
I guess. Sure.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.420
Art is back at last!

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:48.080
But what are they going to do?

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.460
Huh?! Hold on!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.750
Isn't she going to team up with Baldur?

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:00.540
We can't have a first-year girl up against two guys!

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:01.790
Don't worry about it.

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:02.460
What?!

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:04.170
Let the match...

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:07.540
Here we go!

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.130
Uh, hey!

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:10.460
...begin!

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:39.750
Hah!

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:43.290
Uhh, what's going on?!

00:16:43.290 --> 00:16:45.330
She's strong. Way too strong!

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.080
Wait, hold on!

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:49.500
Fiene

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:49.500
Physical Attack

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.500
Physical Defense

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.500
Magic Attack

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.500
Magic Defense

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.290
Her level's maxed out!

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:55.670
Her stats are already maxed out?
Maybe she can just defeat the Witch of Yore on her own.

00:16:55.670 --> 00:16:57.580
When did this happen?

00:16:58.460 --> 00:16:59.250
That's the match.

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:03.580
Are you all right?

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.210
Yeah...

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:09.290
Let me just heal myself.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:11.420
Lanishke.

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.420
But seriously, that was wild.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.000
To think that little girl's capable of this.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.710
Sir Bal, are you all right?

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:30.920
You're as powerful as ever.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:33.040
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:36.500
I totally beat you up without holding back at all!

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:37.710
I see.

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:42.250
Her main skill is healing, yet she also excels at offense.

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.880
I guess she's what they call a DPS healer!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:47.040
But I just don't get why.

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:49.250
How can she be this strong?!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:52.670
It's not clear how she got to be this strong,

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:57.210
but she always casts a supportive spell
on herself before combat.

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:02.330
I heard she once got ambushed by thugs
who slashed her good arm off...

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:03.500
Lanishke.

00:18:04.670 --> 00:18:10.000
...but she used a healing spell to reattach it
immediately and fought the assailants off.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:09.080
Get back here!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:15.580
Jeez, forget the Church's orders,
I'm actually intrigued by this girl now!

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:16.500
Hey, you!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.710
Uh, hey!

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:22.000
Anyway Sieg, I want you to look behind you right away.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.540
Lieselotte?

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:34.830
Looks like she just had to know if you were
getting friendly with Fiene in her absence.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:41.880
What's all this commotion for? I could hear
the racket all the way from the study room I was in!

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:47.670
Well, that's a total lie! We were watching
from Lieselotte's POV the whole time!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:49.250
Liese-tan...

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:52.130
She went straight over to see you after school, Sieg, 

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:56.580
but saw you with Art so she followed behind,
waiting for an opportunity to talk when the match started.

00:18:56.580 --> 00:19:01.960
When she saw Art get knocked out she almost
ran out to help, but figured you had things covered.

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:05.500
Still, she was worried and hid herself
to keep an eye on things.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:21.920
A-are you kidding? How cute is that?!

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:28.790
I'm so sorry for all the noise, Lady Lieselotte.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:29.710
Miss Fiene-

00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:32.880
Hey, you seem awfully cross, my Lady.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:37.250
But Miss Fiene isn't the one at fault here.

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:49.630
May I ask that you refrain from touching me
so casually, Lord Artur, son of Count Richter?

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:50.790
Liese!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:54.250
You stay out of this.
My business is with Miss Fiene alone.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:59.130
Ah, just as I thought. What a miserable-looking wand.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:04.210
Uh, well... it was left in the academy's
lost-and-found box for over half a year, 

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:06.710
and they said I could have it for free.

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:10.920
You call this a wand? If you ask me, 

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:12.880
it's rubbish!

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:16.630
Lieselotte...?

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:20.210
You broke that on purpose, Lieselotte!

00:20:20.210 --> 00:20:23.790
Look at her, the very picture of a villainess!

00:20:25.130 --> 00:20:30.750
I'll have you know, Miss Fiene, that if your wand were
to break during group training or combat, 

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:34.080
it would result in a terrible mess for everyone involved.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:35.880
Do you even realize that?

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.250
That's pretty harsh, Lieselotte!

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:45.330
But actually, if anyone were to get hurt due to the wand
breaking in that situation, it would be Fiene.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:48.830
Honestly, your ignorance appalls me.

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:51.250
This should be somewhat better than that piece of junk...

00:20:51.500 --> 00:20:54.080
Go ahead and take my spare wand.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:58.960
Here. What are you waiting for?

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:04.830
Oh! That's the mystery wand Lieselotte kept
taking out to look at longingly for the past week!

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:08.460
It's clearly too small to actually be Liese-tan's spare
wand.

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:12.710
I see. She must have prepared it
for Miss Fiene from the beginning.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:17.380
S-so this is what they mean by "tsun de rais"!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:20.790
Oh, looks like Siegwald just had some sort of revelation!

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:27.880
Liese-tan must have broken Fiene's wand because
she didn't want her gift to seem like an act of pity.

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:31.250
Oh, my word! Is this not the cutest thing ever?!

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:33.170
Oh, but...

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:36.420
It's too slim a wand for Lieselotte to use.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:41.330
And the material and make of it is better
suited for healing and supportive magic.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:43.960
Huh...

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:46.630
I can't possibly accept such a fine wand...

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:50.460
Umm...

00:21:50.460 --> 00:21:51.580
You should take it.

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:53.290
I'm sure it'll be perfect for you!

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:56.710
Do Liese a favor and take it
as her way of making amends.

00:21:58.960 --> 00:22:02.670
All right. Thank you very much, Lady Lieselotte.

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:08.960
It's just a spare. I don't need it in the slightest, you hear?

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:11.580
That's very kind of you, Lieselotte.

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:17.630
I-I have no idea what you mean by that!

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:19.250
Allow me to take my leave!

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:33.960
Lieselotte, I find myself growing fonder and fonder...

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:36.960
of who you actually are.

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:44.790
Gaah! Liese-tan's too friggin' cute!

00:22:48.670 --> 00:22:54.670
Kurushiku kanjiru hodo mabushii hohoemi o

00:22:54.670 --> 00:23:00.290
Imadani massugu mirenai watashi

00:23:00.790 --> 00:23:06.880
Kokoro no fukaku de chirabatta kimochi o

00:23:06.880 --> 00:23:12.540
Yukkuri atsumete yuku youni

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:19.250
Yozora no hoshi ga subete o

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:25.330
Miteruno? Shitteiruno?

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:31.960
Mado o akete toikakeru

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:35.960
Doushite?

00:23:37.750 --> 00:23:43.920
Kono sekai wa kagayaki de michiteiru

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:50.040
Anata no egao ga oshiete kureta

00:23:50.040 --> 00:23:56.040
Shiawase na ketsumatsu o negatte shimau no

00:23:56.420 --> 00:24:06.250
Anata no soba ni ireta nara

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:08.080
Itsumademo

00:24:12.460 --> 00:24:14.420
Itsumademo

00:24:18.460 --> 00:24:22.630
We must have Miss Fiene realize what it means
to be a student of the Royal Academy of Magic.

00:24:22.630 --> 00:24:25.080
Lieselotte, your kindness is truly wonderful.

00:24:25.080 --> 00:24:26.630
Uh?! Y-Your Highness?!

00:24:26.630 --> 00:24:28.670
Next episode: "The Ribbon, the Upperclassman,
and Feelings of Love."

00:24:28.670 --> 00:24:30.580
My Lieselotte is as cute as ever next week!

00:24:30.580 --> 00:24:32.380
Ack! Y-Y-Your Highness!

00:24:31.420 --> 00:24:32.960
The Ribbon, the Upperclassman, and Feelings of Love
